    "turn_text": "Look, you know, I think that Hillary Clinton performed wonderfully under really tough circumstances. I've said this publicly. I'll repeat it. I think there was a double standard with her. For whatever reason, there's been a long-standing difficulty in her relationship with the press that meant her flaws were wildly amplified relative to... Not",
